WEBVTT

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:08.680
I'm sure I was waiting here.

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:11.990
Waiting for a wind, to blow away something

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:15.790
that had stayed in one place
for far too long and gone stale...

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:31.080
I kept waiting here.

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:05.970
<b>Second Hour: Hayami</b>

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:06.460
Tacky!

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:08.650
It's morning.

00:02:08.650 --> 00:02:10.290
Wake up!

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:13.110
Morning, Uncle.

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:15.440
Hey, Tacky!

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:16.980
What the hell do you think you're doing,

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:19.770
getting up early on a Sunday?

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:22.140
Do you want me back in bed,
or do you want me getting up?

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:27.860
How can you refuse my good morning kiss?

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:33.030
I'm meeting a friend today.

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:38.090
And there's somewhere I want to stop first.

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:43.210
The weather's great again today.

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:55.690
You came again.

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:58.290
Hinata-chan and the others are going
to show me around the village.

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:01.820
I'm sure it would be even better
with more people.

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:04.710
So come on.

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:17.810
Um...

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:21.320
Stay away from me.

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:23.810
I believe I told you that already.

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:37.360
Takuma-kun!

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:43.600
Huh?

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:49.760
Sorry...

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:54.310
When I see you, I just want to
give you a full-on tackle.

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:57.320
My chest still hurts...

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:02.410
Looks like you're used to it now.

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:03.980
Yeah.

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:08.430
I never thought I'd be able to see again.

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:12.410
The doctors said it was in God's hands.

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:15.360
You can't waste it.

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:17.800
I'll do enough to make up for
all the things I couldn't,

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:19.070
one thing at a time.

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:20.840
That's the way!

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:25.200
As long as you don't give up,
you can do anything.

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:28.050
Do your best.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:30.250
Otoha-chan.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:34.480
Hirose-sama...

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:37.750
Good morning!

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:39.060
Hinata-chan!

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:42.020
Morning, everyone!

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:44.510
Right, why don't you...

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:48.660
Huh? Otoha-chan?

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:52.740
A waterwheel...

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:55.670
Do they not use it anymore?

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:57.600
It's old.

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:58.900
Let's go.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:00.680
Wait!

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:05.650
How dare you ignore me, Yui-sama!

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:08.440
She sounds like Yui-chan...

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:09.650
I am Yui-chan!

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:11.650
Nice to see you helping the family.

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:14.890
Don't look down on me!

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:17.790
It can't be helped, given
where we're standing...

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:24.420
And get this, transfer student.

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:27.540
All the fields around here belong
to the Tabata family.

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:33.170
In a way, I am a god, who supports
the village's stomachs!

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:39.660
If you swear loyalty to me, I'll let you weed.

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:43.970
And on this side, all these are Hinata-chan's.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:49.130
They're not mine.
They belong to the Kagura family.

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:51.640
Then she's surpassed godhood.

00:05:52.670 --> 00:05:55.440
Hamaji!

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:57.630
Yui-sama, this is tough.

00:05:57.630 --> 00:05:59.880
You're making us do all the work.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:01.850
Shut up, servants A and B!

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:05.680
Looks like they'll be a while. Let's go.

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:17.160
It's so nice and cold!

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:19.380
Be careful. It's slippery.

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:24.430
You're one to talk, Hinata-chan.

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:27.080
Hinata-chan, are you okay?

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:31.450
This is the Village Head's house...

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:33.300
Basically, Hinata-chan's house.

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:35.980
Wow, you're amazing, Hinata-chan.

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:47.020
My dream is to wear a wedding dress here.

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:48.910
That's a cute dream.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.900
Yui-chan's tiny and kind of foul-mouthed,

00:06:53.900 --> 00:06:55.970
but she's actually a really hard worker.

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:57.170
Hey!

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:59.400
Why did you come back here?

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:12.810
Wow!

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:14.940
There's a hanging bridge.

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:16.810
What's over there?

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:20.410
Whatever you do, don't cross that bridge!

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:22.620
Why?

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:26.980
A nasty demon lives on the other side!

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:29.010
That's what we've always been told.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:31.380
A nasty demon that once harmed the village...

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.570
And it's still alive over there!

00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:38.600
Hinata-chan, do you believe that...

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.540
Hinata-chan?

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:49.880
I think that's the majority of it.

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:52.170
Thanks, it was fun.

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:54.220
Sorry for the wait!

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:57.680
I hope you enjoyed your tour of Sawai Village!

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:00.160
This is some service from me.

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:01.130
Hamaji!

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:03.360
Why are you suddenly dressed like a maid?

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:05.880
This is the uniform here.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:08.710
I help out sometimes.

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:09.600
Didn't you know?

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:11.640
I didn't want to know.

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:14.310
Wait, and I'll find some food.

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:17.710
A lot has expired!

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:20.940
Expired... What do you mean expired?

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:22.180
Hey, Hamaji!

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:23.270
Wait!

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:26.120
Here you go, Hinata-chan.

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:27.940
Hinata-chan?

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:30.240
Is something wrong?

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:31.130
Huh?

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:34.630
You haven't said anything since
we were at that bridge.

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:37.180
No, I'm sorry.

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:41.870
What's on the other side of the bridge?

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:55.550
An demon lives on the other
side of the bridge...

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:58.310
Hinata-chan...

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:02.810
There's no such thing as demons.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:07.090
You know that.

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:10.530
Hinata-chan?

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:31.180
A demon, huh?

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:17.000
The water's beautiful.

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:46.030
Um...

00:10:46.030 --> 00:10:47.090
Hayami-chan?

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:49.540
If you cut someone with a knife,

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:52.820
the bones and blood and fat will ruin it.

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:53.970
It's fine.

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:57.470
This blade is the Doujigiri.

00:10:57.470 --> 00:11:00.040
Why do you have one of the
Five Swords Under Heaven?

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:20.320
Why did you come here?

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:24.310
Ow...

00:11:24.820 --> 00:11:26.730
I wanted to see the demon.

00:11:29.150 --> 00:11:32.200
I'm repaying you for before.

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:44.470
I'm told you showed Hirose-sama
around the village.

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:48.490
Yes. He seemed very happy.

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:53.320
I'm told Hirose-sama crossed the bridge.

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:06.820
It's nice to eat cup noodles outside.

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:08.670
Hurry and eat. Then leave.

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:10.770
You're cold.

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:14.950
I told you to stay away from me.

00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:16.780
No good will come of it, not a bit.

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:18.900
Yeah?

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:23.140
That ramen you gave me was good.

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:24.660
That's...

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:31.830
Isn't that small thing enough of a start?

00:12:32.370 --> 00:12:35.500
Enough for us to get to know each other,
to become friends?

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:58.540
I don't need friends.

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:00.720
Why?

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:03.130
Why do you try to make everyone hate you?

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:05.380
It's just painful for you.

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:08.070
It's necessary.

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:12.010
I deserve to be hated.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:19.510
I have to be hated...

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:43.970
Hirose-sama...

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:48.380
What's wrong, Hinata-chan?

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:49.610
It's late.

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:53.920
Why did you cross the bridge?

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:57.050
I wanted to talk to Hayami-chan.

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:03.250
Why does everyone dislike her?

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:06.800
Well...

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:10.000
You don't really like that, do you?

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:11.200
You really want—

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:12.580
Kohinata-san is...

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:15.130
You must stay away from her!

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:17.150
But...

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:18.500
You have to!

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:30.100
He already left?

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:32.580
Left first thing in the morning.

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:37.180
Jeez! What's wrong with that kid, anyway?

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:40.770
Kids shouldn't be able to get up by themselves.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:43.690
I wish he acted more like a kid, you know...

00:14:58.340 --> 00:14:59.890
You okay?

00:15:00.570 --> 00:15:02.510
It doesn't hurt.

00:15:02.510 --> 00:15:04.990
You want salt or soy sauce?

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:07.050
Cup noodles first thing in the morning...

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:10.000
That's too much luxury for me.

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:15.930
Morning, Hayami-chan.

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:25.970
Wait, Hayami-chan!

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:29.140
Pervert!

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:31.440
That's not it! Really!

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:36.260
I just thought that you'd have to
eat quick, or you'd be late...

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:38.380
I told you not to come!

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:41.560
That girl at the Yakumo's store is cute.

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:43.030
Let's stop there today.

00:15:43.030 --> 00:15:45.040
Her brother's annoying, though.

00:15:46.640 --> 00:15:48.390
First thing in the morning,
and we run into the cockroach.

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:50.190
That's bad luck.

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:52.880
Who was with her?

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:54.970
Must be another cockroach.

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:57.800
They're multiplying?

00:15:59.010 --> 00:16:04.660
Today in art class, we'll be making pinwheels
for our next science class.

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:07.770
Everyone has their tools and materials, right?

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.010
Right!

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:10.440
Hirose-san—

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:11.820
Hayami-chan, let's trade!

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:16.370
If you show me how to make one,
I'll lend you my tools.

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:19.090
Give and take.

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:21.140
Stupid.

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:24.260
Hirose-sama, please make it with me.

00:16:24.260 --> 00:16:26.830
I want to make it with you.

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:30.100
Hinata-chan's so bold!

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:31.760
Hirose-sama...

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:35.110
Okay, we'll do it with Hayami-chan.

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:37.780
Hirose!

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:41.110
How can you put Hinata and
the cockroach together?

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:44.820
Yui-chan, there aren't any cockroaches here.

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:47.090
Wh-What?

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:51.920
Kohinata-san, what is this?

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:53.450
Nothing.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:56.730
The idiot and the rich girl are making
a big deal out of nothing.

00:16:57.560 --> 00:16:59.430
Hayami-chan!

00:16:59.430 --> 00:17:02.050
Looks like I'm in the way.

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:11.340
Tabata-san. Want me to play with you?

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:16.010
Bratty cockroach...

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:26.080
Sensei, stop them!

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:26.890
This is crazy...

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:31.350
No...

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:34.000
Hirose-sama!

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:35.870
Why?

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:38.440
Please.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:56.150
You're a brat, cockroach.

00:17:56.150 --> 00:17:57.000
Servant B!

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:57.450
Right!

00:17:57.450 --> 00:17:59.820
Take this!

00:18:02.630 --> 00:18:04.390
She stinks!

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:05.930
Cockroaches are filthy.

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:08.470
Toilet water.

00:18:08.470 --> 00:18:10.860
You've gone from cockroach to a stinkbug.

00:18:12.010 --> 00:18:14.100
Who said you could get up?

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:16.260
Crawl on the ground, cockroach.

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:17.080
That's right!

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:17.950
Know your place!

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:18.810
Hayami-chan!

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:26.270
No!

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.660
Stay away from me.

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:30.660
Go back...

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:31.990
Shut up!

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:40.480
If you touch this filthy thing,
you're a cockroach, too.

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:42.270
You want me to step on you, as well?

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:45.700
Hirose...

00:19:24.110 --> 00:19:25.520
Hirose!

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:28.710
If you touch this filthy thing,
you're a cockroach, too.

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:31.070
We dumped toilet water on her.

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:32.690
She stinks!

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:38.440
Hayami-chan's not filthy.

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:40.230
Hirose, let me go.

00:19:40.230 --> 00:19:41.740
I'm dirty.

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:45.030
I want to do what I can.

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:50.470
Because up till now, I couldn't do anything.

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:52.680
Then it's decided!

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:54.020
You're a cockroach, too!

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:55.510
There are more cockroaches now.

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:56.930
Cockroach Hirose!

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:57.530
Let's go.

00:19:57.530 --> 00:19:58.160
Wait!

00:19:58.160 --> 00:20:00.110
Who said you could go?

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:02.140
You bastard.

00:20:02.140 --> 00:20:04.150
Wait!

00:20:04.150 --> 00:20:08.060
Hirose-sama isn't a cockroach!

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:09.650
He's not like Kohinata-san.

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:12.470
Hinata?

00:20:12.470 --> 00:20:16.560
I'm going to save him from Kohinata-san.

00:20:17.590 --> 00:20:19.760
On my name as a Kagura.

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:21.860
So...

00:20:23.510 --> 00:20:26.310
You're really an idiot, doing this.

00:20:26.310 --> 00:20:27.460
Tomorrow, you need to...

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.980
Tomorrow, you need to apologize to Yui.

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:37.020
And then stay away from me, once and for all!

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:39.350
You're still saying that?

00:20:39.350 --> 00:20:42.840
Come on, give me your hand.

00:21:31.340 --> 00:21:33.260
It's quiet.

00:21:33.260 --> 00:21:34.770
Yeah.

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:39.710
I wish the wind would blow.

00:21:41.310 --> 00:21:44.790
The wind already blew.

00:21:49.710 --> 00:21:51.710
A new wind...

00:21:51.710 --> 00:21:55.090
A new wind, to blow away
something that's gone stale...

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:09.640
It's spinning!

00:24:00.690 --> 00:24:02.790
Yui-chan really takes her work seriously.

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:05.150
This is for my great ambition!

00:24:05.150 --> 00:24:06.070
Ambition?

00:24:06.070 --> 00:24:08.580
I'm going to save up my money and get it...

00:24:08.580 --> 00:24:11.310
The red tractor of a planter girl!

00:24:11.310 --> 00:24:12.120
Yui's!

00:24:11.510 --> 00:24:14.800
<b>Third Hour: Hinata</b>

00:24:12.120 --> 00:24:13.010
Ma's!

00:24:13.010 --> 00:24:14.760
Weather forecast!
